# M6 route map in Hackl form (D-098): Strobl -> Bad Ischl in Wait with
# Hackl Resi on the Bad Ischl dot (her box 8 px taller: both alternate
# label slots, Bad Ischl left of its dot and Café Zauner raised, must clear
# her), then the Bad Ischl intro drawing `player_hackl`. A test route puts
# the `hackl` level in Strobl's slot (station 7 of 9; the D-047 `route`
# header, as flow_hackl_carry_over and bad_ischl_hackl_axes do), so the
# map screen is the real Strobl -> Bad Ischl one without a Hackl route
# through Stages 4-7: the first 1343 frames of bad_ischl_hackl_axes (title,
# the hackl run, H-box, three axes, its Maibaum at 1343), then idle: the
# tally, the route map (1652; Wait from 1736), no START: the Bad Ischl
# intro at 2036, play from 2186 as Hackl, 30 frames. Shots: the map in
# Wait as Hackl (1794, prompt on; the Normal form is strobl_tour's
# `route_map`) and the Bad Ischl intro as Hackl (2056).
level  = hackl
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
route  = salzburg st_gilgen brunnwinkl falkenstein st_wolfgang wolfgangsee hackl bad_ischl
expect = complete frames=1343..1343 deaths=0 no_event=Hurt
expect = state=playing stage=bad_ischl power=hackl score=5450 lives=3
shots  = 1794:route_map 2056:intro
